.TH "nvme_init_identify_ports_list" 9 "nvme_init_identify_ports_list" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_identify_ports_list \- Initialize passthru command for Get Ports List
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_identify_ports_list
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_ports_list *list "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Command data structure to initialize
.IP "list" 12
User space destination address to transfer the data
.IP "len" 12
The allocated length of \fIlist\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Identify command with
CNS value NVME_IDENTIFY_CNS_PORTS_LIST.
